        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Djenné</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 200 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">The nearby site of Djenné-Djeno was first settled around 200 BCE according to excavations of 1977 and 1981; the present town was first settled after 1000 CE, while oral tradition dates its founding to 635 and names a legendary founder, Maafir.</span></div>
